{{trans-top-see|free of charge|free of charge|gratuitous}}
* Spanish:
{{trans-bottom}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# In a [[free#English:_free of charge|free]] way: without [[charge]].
#: {{syn|en|costlessly|free of charge#Adverb}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Henry 4-2|act=IV|scene=iii|passage=I know not how they sold themselves: but thou, like a kind fellow, gavest thyself away '''gratis'''; and I thank thee for thee.}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Merry Wives|act=I|scene=ii|page=45|passage=Reaſon, you roague, reaſon: thinkſt thou Ile endanger my soule, '''''gratis'''''?}}

